/// **Source**:
/// Loads values from the `.env` file via `flutter_dotenv`.
///
/// **Business Logic**:
/// - Enforces the Zero-Compromise Pledge (Fail-Fast) by requiring all variables
///   to be present in the `.env` file. No silent fallbacks exist.
@riverpod
Env env(Ref ref) {
