          "ai_description": "CRITICAL MANDATE: THE DEFAULT SCORE IS 1. You are strictly forbidden from granting a score higher than 1 unless you can extract direct, irrefutable, and explicit textual evidence that satisfies every single condition of the higher tiers. Passive or implicit logic results in an automatic score of 1."
